    "prompt": "Evaluate $$\\int_{1/\\sqrt3}^{\\sqrt3}\\frac{\\arctan(x)\\log^2(x)}{x}\\,dx.$$ (Here $\\log$ is the natural logarithm and $\\log^2x=(\\log x)^2$.)",
    "image": null,
