        "body": "Let $x=\\sin t$: $$\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\frac{dt}{8+\\sin^2t}.$$ With $u=\\tan t$, $\\sin^2t=\\frac{u^2}{1+u^2}$ and $dt=\\frac{du}{1+u^2}$: $$\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{du}{8(1+u^2)+u^2}=\\int_{-\\infty}^\\infty\\frac{du}{8+9u^2}=\\frac1{3\\sqrt8}\\cdot\\pi=\\frac\\pi{6\\sqrt2}.$$\n\n**Answer: $\\frac{\\pi}{6\\sqrt2}$**"
