    "prompt": "Evaluate $$\\int_0^1\\left(2^{\\sqrt x}\\log^2(2)+\\log^2(1+x)\\right)dx.$$ (Here $\\log$ is the natural logarithm and $\\log^2x=(\\log x)^2$.)",
