    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Evaluate each part",
        "body": "**First part.** With $x=u^2$: $\\int_0^12^{\\sqrt x}\\log^22\\,dx=2\\log^22\\int_0^1u\\,2^u\\,du$. Let $w=u\\log2$: this is $2\\int_0^{\\log2}we^w\\,dw=2\\left[(w-1)e^w\\right]_0^{\\log2}=2\\left(2\\log2-1\\right)$.\n\n**Second part.** With $y=\\log(1+x)$, $x=e^y-1$: $\\int_0^{\\log2}y^2e^y\\,dy=\\left[(y^2-2y+2)e^y\\right]_0^{\\log2}=2(\\log^22-2\\log2+2)-2=2\\log^22-4\\log2+2$.\n\nSum: $4\\log2-2+2\\log^22-4\\log2+2=2\\log^22$.\n\n**Answer: $2\\log^22$**"
